---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, LAST_UPDATED } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title="Cookies: Nettopalkka sets none at all" description="The Finnish net pay, tax, pension and Kela calculators set no cookie and store nothing about you. Site stability is monitored anonymously with Microsoft Clarity, cookie-free." lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Cookies' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h1>Cookies</h1>
    <p>Supplement to the <a href={route('privacy', lang)}>privacy policy</a>.</p>
    <h2>No cookies</h2><p>No page of the site sets a cookie, and the calculators keep nothing on your device: salary, municipality and every other input live in the open page and vanish when you close it. Hence no cookie banner either: there is nothing to accept.</p>
    <h2>Anonymous stability monitoring</h2><p>To notice broken pages, script errors, slow loading and buttons that do not respond, the site loads Microsoft Clarity in its cookie-free mode. Clarity then sets no cookie (no <code>_clck</code>, <code>_clsk</code>, <code>MUID</code> or <code>CLID</code>), assigns each page view a one-off identifier and never joins your visits together. Page content and inputs are masked before anything leaves the browser.</p>
    <h2>Blocking it</h2><p>To opt out of even this, block the clarity.ms domain or use a content blocker; the calculators keep working exactly as before.</p>
    <p>Questions: <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>. Last updated: {LAST_UPDATED}.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
